  "|An embargo is a government order that:|Permits free trade|Restricts or prohibits trade with a specific country|Increases import tariffs|Promotes foreign investment": "foreign-policy",
  "|The principle of judicial review means courts can:|Make new laws|Review and invalidate laws that conflict with the constitution|Sentence criminals without trial|Create executive orders": "organs",
